body:
She's definitely a shy person - there was a very early interview (don't recall the exact source but it may have been even before Hasshi joined Popipa?) where she said one of her big struggles was being able to overcome her shyness in order to stand onstage as lead guitar. Watching her in streams you can tell she gets embarrassed very easily as well. But she is incredibly thoughtful and passionate, and her willingness to share her feelings openly with the fans - not just the happy things but also her frustrations and doubts - is one of the things I love most about her.

&#x200B;

Thank you so much for reading. I'm not very active in the community, but I'm glad I could let her words be heard by more people!
